# Allowlist: ignore everything, then re-include only the files worth
# backing up. Session logs, caches, and anything token-like stay OUT.
*
!.gitignore
!CLAUDE.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!settings.json
!hooks/
!hooks/**
!git-hooks/
!git-hooks/**
!project-template/
!project-template/**
!skills/
!skills/**
# Memory notes (per-project facts Claude saves across sessions) — but not
# the session transcripts that live next to them under projects/.
!projects/
projects/*
!projects/*/
projects/*/*
!projects/*/memory/
!projects/*/memory/**
